---Whether this item should be moved to the hub when space platform performs building, upgrade or deconstruction and is left with this item. The following items are considered valuable and moved to hub by default: [Modules](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/ModulePrototype.html), [items that build entities](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/ItemPrototype.html%23place_result#place_result), [items that build tiles](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/ItemPrototype.html%23place_as_tile#place_as_tile) and items [not obtainable from asteroid chunks](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/AsteroidChunkPrototype.html%23minable#minable) that have [subgroup](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/PrototypeBase.html%23subgroup#subgroup) from a [group](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/ItemSubGroup.html%23group#group) other than `"intermediate-products"`.
